## 💡 Analytical Approach

The project follows a business-focused analytical workflow:

**Business Problem → Data → Analysis → Visualization → Insight → Decision Support**

The focus is on converting business data into an interactive dashboard that allows users to explore performance and derive meaningful business insights.

